<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>REIC Component Studio — OS MEDIA VM</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="./component-detail.css"><script src="./component-detail.js" defer></script></head><body><header class="bar"><a href="../index.html">OS MEDIA VM</a><span>REIC COMPONENT STUDIO</span><span class="live">● LOCAL RUNTIME</span></header><main><aside class="rail"><p class="eyebrow">KATALOG MODUL</p><label for="search">Cari komponen</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Nama komponen…"><div class="map-controls"><label for="layer">Lapisan sistem</label><select id="layer"><option value="all">Semua lapisan</option></select><label for="group">Domain</label><select id="group"><option value="all">Semua domain</option></select></div><div id="catalog" class="catalog"></div><p class="note">Setiap item dibuka sebagai panel detail mandiri.</p></aside><section class="work"><div class="crumb">WORKSPACE / REIC / COMPONENT</div><div class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">OS MEDIA VM · ENTERPRISE</p><h1 id="title">Identitas merek dan logo utama</h1><p id="desc">Panel detail setiap komponen REIC, dengan kontrol, status, dan log aktivitas.</p></div><span id="number" class="number">REIC 00001</span></div><div class="stats"><article><small>KOMPONEN</small><strong id="statName">Identitas merek</strong></article><article><small>RUNTIME</small><strong>Browser / REIC</strong></article><article><small>STATUS</small><strong id="state">Siap</strong></article></div><div class="map-summary"><strong id="mapCount">Pemetaan belum dimuat</strong><span id="layerInfo">Layer 001 / 1000</span><span id="gridInfo">Posisi: menunggu manifest</span></div><div id="workspace" class="workspace"></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><small class="eyebrow">PANEL KONTROL</small><h2 id="panelTitle">Identitas merek dan logo utama</h2></div><span class="tag">INTERAKTIF</span></div><p id="panelDesc">Atur dan periksa status komponen ini. Aksi demo diproses di browser tanpa mengirim data ke server.</p><label for="value">Nilai / parameter</label><input id="value" placeholder="Masukkan nilai atau catatan"><div class="actions"><button id="run">Jalankan aksi</button><button id="reset" class="secondary">Reset</button><button id="copy" class="secondary">Salin ringkasan</button></div><p id="status" role="status">Modul siap digunakan.</p><h3>Log aktivitas</h3><pre id="log">[READY] Workspace REIC siap.</pre></div><details class="files" open><summary>Berkas modul</summary><div class="file-row"><span>.reic</span><code id="reicFile">reic-00001-identitas-merek.reic</code></div><div class="file-row"><span>.css</span><code id="cssFile">reic-00001-identitas-merek.css</code></div><div class="file-row"><span>.js</span><code id="jsFile">reic-00001-identitas-merek.js</code></div></details><p class="footnote">Arsitektur: setiap komponen mempunyai ID, domain, nomor lapisan, koordinat grid, serta jalur berkas .reic/.css/.js. Banyak panel dapat dibuka bersamaan. Catatan: tampilan ini adalah studio antarmuka. Database, login enterprise, layanan cloud, dan AI membutuhkan konfigurasi backend tersendiri.</p></section></main></body></html>